So, we added new items:

 2A42-M3 30 mm cannon;
 Drag chute;
 Ejection seat;
 Dual-mode autopilot;
 Inertial Controller (iOS/Android control tool);

These items available in parts shop with huge discount! Only now, limited time!
---------------------------------------
List of major improvements:

 Fracture physics rewritten;
 Vehicle dynamics rewritten;
 Vehicle graphics completely redesigned;
 Pilot ragdoll redesigned.
 Changes in gameplay.
 AI bots;
 Realistic physics of explosions;
 Sound improvements (side effect, other effects);


Some words about.
AI buggy bots mod will be activated when you buy and activate the cannon. Without cannon some buggy bots is still active and waiting you. Dont ask where, I sure that you are able to find them.
Drag chute is great tool if you like to go faster as hellfire. 
Ejection seat is really most useful thing. Dont forget to fine tune the autoejection logic in Tuning tab. Remember that if your pilot will collide with anything in ejection procedure he will die.
Dont forget about autopilot settings (top-right MFD):
http://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/9301899/9540ac66dcea7b80d7df33bcd6f7bd4ea410aaf4.png

Good luck!

