Dear friends!
We present you a small roadmap about the upcoming update.
So, the screenshots first:

http://jrex.srj-studio.com/images/191015/shot1.png
http://jrex.srj-studio.com/images/191015/shot2.png
http://jrex.srj-studio.com/images/191015/shot3.png
http://jrex.srj-studio.com/images/191015/shot5.png

What was done since the last release:

A completely new UI (Aerospace HUD styled);
Vehicle completely redesigned;
New skins (10 standard and six premium-class);
Shaders rewritten to support physical effects;
Improved lighting and visual appearance;
A completely new controls (we heard you), but the old controls is also available;
Rewritten parts shop, it is now possible to switch between the stock parts and upgraded;
A new feature - inertial joystick. Now you have more comfort and flexible controls;
Improved compatibility with other joysticks and steering wheels;
Rewritten aerodynamics and physics;
Rewritten camera behaviour;
AI test mode;
Fixed bugs and inaccuracies.


And, of course, there are new locations in development!

About dates: we wanted to publish last weekend, but did not. There are  unfinished tasks here. We will try as soon as possible.

