Now this controller is fully supported. You can map controls as you wish.

This control scheme is recommended as default:

Right trigger - throttle;
Left trigger - wheel brake;
Left stick - steering;
Right stick X: direct steering;
Right stick Y: Airbrake;

Map buttons as you need.

The controller was tested on Windows and OSX platforms.

